---
import {airports,planPriceText,planTrafficText,sourceLabel,type Airport} from '../data/airports';
import {brandEditorials} from '../data/brand-editorials';
import {questionsForBrand} from '../data/brand-faq';
import {explainPlan,planComparison} from '../lib/brand-content';
import {entryUrl,type Entry} from '../lib/content';
import Coupon from './Coupon.astro';
import BrandEvidence from './BrandEvidence.astro';
import {evidenceFor} from '../data/evidence';
import BrandSnapshot from './BrandSnapshot.astro';
import CouponConditions from './CouponConditions.astro';
import BrandBuyingGuide from './BrandBuyingGuide.astro';
import BrandFactHistory from './BrandFactHistory.astro';
import '../styles/brand-decisions.css';
interface Props{brand:Airport;entries:Entry[]}
const {brand:a,entries}=Astro.props;
const reference=a.sourceType==='reference';
const evidence=evidenceFor(a.slug);
const editorial=brandEditorials[a.slug];
const readings=editorial.readings.map(url=>{const entry=entries.find(x=>entryUrl(x)===url);if(!entry)throw Error('Unknown brand reading '+url);return entry;});
const peers=editorial.comparisons.map(slug=>airports.find(x=>x.slug===slug)!);
const siblings=airports.filter(x=>x.kind===a.kind);const position=siblings.findIndex(x=>x.slug===a.slug);
const previous=siblings[(position-1+siblings.length)%siblings.length];const next=siblings[(position+1)%siblings.length];
const sections=[['brand-overview','核心解读'],['selection-heading','站长结论'],['plans-heading','套餐说明'],['coupon-heading','优惠条件'],['profile-heading','节点与设备'],['performance-evidence','测速记录'],['brand-faq','常见问题'],['brand-reading','相关教程'],['brand-alternatives','品牌对照'],['sources-heading','来源记录'],['brand-fact-history','维护记录']];
---
<BrandSnapshot brand={a}/>
<nav class="brand-section-nav" aria-label="品牌内容快捷导航">{sections.map(([id,title])=><a href={'#'+id}>{title}</a>)}</nav>
<div class="brand-workspace">
 <div class="brand-details" data-brand-editorial={a.slug}>
  <section aria-labelledby="brand-overview"><p class="eyebrow">BRAND BRIEF / 核心解读</p><h2 id="brand-overview">{editorial.focus}</h2><p>{editorial.analysis}</p><p>{editorial.caution}</p><div class="profile-status"><span>{a.kind==='airport'?'订阅机场':'商业 VPN'}</span><span>{sourceLabel(a)}</span><span>{a.plans.length} 档已收录方案</span><span>{evidence?'已收录测速与解锁图':'实测待补充'}</span></div></section>
  <BrandBuyingGuide brand={a}/>
  <section aria-labelledby="plans-heading"><p class="eyebrow">PLAN SHEET / 套餐资料</p><h2 id="plans-heading">价格、流量与计费方式</h2><p>{reference?'以下为第三方参考资料，读取套餐表不代表已经核验商家当前结算。':'以下条件对应所列官方来源，尚未进行独立实测。'}付款周期和流量发放分别保留；不把未知倍率默认成一倍。</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>{a.name} · {a.plans.length} 档已收录方案</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">套餐</th><th scope="col">价格 / 计费口径</th><th scope="col">流量 / 发放口径</th><th scope="col">补充说明</th></tr></thead><tbody>{a.plans.length?a.plans.map(p=><tr><th scope="row">{p.name}</th><td>{planPriceText(p)}</td><td>{planTrafficText(p)}</td><td>{p.note||'条件以对应官方说明为准。'}<br/>流量倍率：{p.multiplier??'尚未核实'}</td></tr>):<tr><td colspan="4">套餐价格与流量尚未核实，空白不表示免费或不限量。</td></tr>}</tbody></table></div>
  <div class="plan-explainers">{a.plans.map(p=>explainPlan(p)).map(note=><div><h3>{note.name}：怎样理解这档方案</h3><p>{note.payment}</p><p>{note.quota}</p></div>)}</div><div class="plan-decision"><h3>这些方案怎样放在一起比较</h3><p>{planComparison(a)}</p><a href="/blog/plan-cost/" class="text-link">读懂付款周期与流量倍率 →</a></div><a class="selection-tool-link" href="/tools/traffic-calculator/"><div><strong>这档流量够不够？先算自己的任务。</strong><span>按视频、会议、文件与使用人数估算，再回来核对本品牌的额度和计费规则。</span></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></section>

  <section aria-labelledby="coupon-heading"><p class="eyebrow">CHECKOUT / 优惠与结算</p><h2 id="coupon-heading">优惠信息怎样使用</h2><CouponConditions slug={a.slug}/>{a.coupon?<><p>当前记录优惠码 <code>{a.coupon.code}</code>，对应优惠价由站长确认为永久有效。具体折扣比例、适用套餐和叠加规则分别核对；这里不自动计算券后金额。</p><ol><li>先选定满足自己任务的套餐，确认完整付款周期和币种。</li><li>在结算页输入代码，核对是否显示具体优惠及适用条件。</li><li>确认最终实付、续费金额与退款说明，保留不含账号凭据的记录。</li></ol><a class="text-link" href="/guides/check-coupon-without-payment/">教程：付款前检查优惠条件 →</a></>:<><p>{a.kind==='vpn'?'本站没有记录维护者提供的优惠码；官方免费方案与付费促销应分别查看。':'维护者未提供该品牌优惠码。未提供不等于商家一定没有活动，本页也不会根据其他同名品牌补写折扣。'}结算时以当前套餐、完整账单及续费规则为准，不把展示起价或活动口号当作最终金额。</p><a class="text-link" href="/blog/checkout-amount/">怎样核对结算金额 →</a></>}</section>
  <section aria-labelledby="profile-heading"><p class="eyebrow">NETWORK & DEVICES</p><h2 id="profile-heading">节点、客户端与设备条件</h2><dl class="brand-facts"><div><dt>节点地区</dt><dd>{a.regions.join('、')||'尚未核实'}</dd></div><div><dt>协议</dt><dd>{a.protocols.join('、')||'尚未核实'}</dd></div><div><dt>设备限制</dt><dd>{a.deviceLimit||'尚未核实'}</dd></div></dl><p>节点地区、协议与设备限制应分别核对。未知字段不表示没有限制；跨系统使用前，还应确认目标设备、配置格式和对应方案权限是否一致。</p><p>使用前应从可信发布渠道核对客户端、系统要求和配置格式。{a.kind==='airport'?'订阅链接和配置可能包含访问凭据，应按密码保管。':'官方应用和第三方配置的适用条件应分别核对。'}不要将完整订阅、账号或未经脱敏的日志发送到公开页面。</p><div class="inline-reading">{[['Windows','windows'],['Android','android'],['iOS','ios'],['macOS','macos']].map(([title,slug])=><a href={'/guides/'+slug+'/'}>{title} 使用前检查 ↗</a>)}</div></section>
  {evidence?<BrandEvidence record={evidence}/>:<>  <section aria-labelledby="performance-evidence" class="evidence-pending" data-evidence-state="pending"><p class="eyebrow">MEASUREMENTS / 实测证据</p><h2 id="performance-evidence">测速与稳定性记录</h2><span class="tag neutral">待补充可复核记录</span><p>当前未发布{a.name}的独立测速图或稳定性记录。套餐价格、线路名称与流量额度不能替代实际测量，也不能据此承诺 AI、流媒体或任何地区的持续可用性。</p><p>可复核结果应对应测试时间、本地运营商、设备与客户端、节点、测试目标及单位。单张截图可以支持当时条件下的观察；长期稳定性还需要多时段、成功与失败样本以及故障恢复记录。</p><div class="inline-reading"><a href="/blog/stability-method/">阅读稳定性记录方法 ↗</a><a href="/guides/run-controlled-node-test/">怎样做同条件节点对照 ↗</a></div></section></>}
  <section aria-labelledby="brand-faq"><p class="eyebrow">QUESTIONS / 常见问题</p><h2 id="brand-faq">关于{a.name}，还应确认什么</h2><p>从付款方式、额度与节点条件，逐项解答这个品牌的选购问题。</p>{questionsForBrand(a).map((item,index)=><details class="brand-faq" open={index===0}><summary>{item.question}</summary><p>{item.answer}</p></details>)}<div class="inline-reading"><a href="/blog/post-purchase-validation/">付款后怎样核对权益 →</a><a href="/blog/official-reference-test/">参考资料与独立实测如何区分 →</a></div></section>
  <section aria-labelledby="brand-reading"><p class="eyebrow">READING ROUTE / 延伸阅读</p><h2 id="brand-reading">继续读懂相关条件</h2><p>按这个品牌的付款模型、额度或线路问题选择阅读入口，再回到套餐核对具体字段。</p><div class="brand-reading-list">{readings.map(entry=><a href={entryUrl(entry)}><span>{entry.data.section==='guides'?'操作教程':entry.data.section==='glossary'?'基础百科':'知识文章'}</span><strong>{entry.data.title}</strong><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>)}</div></section>
  <section aria-labelledby="brand-alternatives"><p class="eyebrow">SIDE BY SIDE / 对照资料</p><h2 id="brand-alternatives">还可以怎样建立对照</h2><p>{editorial.comparisonReason}</p><div class="brand-crosslinks">{peers.map(peer=><div><a href={'/airport/'+peer.slug+'/'}><strong>{peer.name}</strong><span>{brandEditorials[peer.slug].focus}</span></a><a class="text-link" href={'/compare/?brands='+a.slug+','+peer.slug}>与 {a.name} 一起比较 ⇄</a></div>)}</div><p class="fine-print">以上是资料阅读与字段对照入口，展示顺序不构成推荐名次或服务质量排名。不同周期和币种分别标明。</p></section>
  <section aria-labelledby="sources-heading"><p class="eyebrow">SOURCE REGISTER</p><h2 id="sources-heading">来源与核验记录</h2><p>{sourceLabel(a)} · {reference?'来源读取日期：'+a.referenceChecked:'官方字段核验日期：'+a.lastVerified}。商家当前报价与连接表现可能变化；本页解读不代表商家实时结算承诺。</p><ul class="sources">{a.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{reference?'节点推荐网对应品牌套餐表':'官方原始资料'} ↗<br/>{s}</a></li>)}</ul><div class="inline-reading"><a href="/contact/">提交资料纠错 →</a><a href="/editorial-policy/">编辑方法与推广披露 →</a>{evidence&&<a href={'/evidence/#'+a.slug}>站长实测图表与原始文件 →</a>}</div></section>
  <BrandFactHistory brand={a}/>
  <nav class="article-pagination brand-pagination" aria-label="品牌前后导航"><a href={'/airport/'+previous.slug+'/'} data-brand-direction="prev"><span>← 上一家{position===0?' · 回到本类最后一家':''}</span><strong>{previous.name}</strong></a><a href={'/airport/'+next.slug+'/'} data-brand-direction="next"><span>下一家 →{position===siblings.length-1?' · 回到本类第一家':''}</span><strong>{next.name}</strong></a></nav><div class="reading-utility"><a href="/airport/">返回全部品牌</a><a href="#main">返回顶部 ↑</a></div>
 </div>
 <aside class="brand-aside" aria-label="品牌入口与比较"><div class="purchase-box"><p class="eyebrow">BRAND ACCESS</p><h2>{a.name}</h2>{a.kind==='airport'&&<Coupon brand={a}/>}<p>{a.coupon?'保留优惠码，不自动计算券后价。先核对套餐与付款周期，再在结算页确认实际优惠。':'未提供维护者优惠码，请查阅品牌当前结算与续费条款。'}</p>{a.affiliateUrl?<><a class="button" href={a.affiliateUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer">前往品牌推广入口 ↗</a><p>商业披露：通过此链接注册或购买，本站可能获得佣金。推广链接由维护者提供，域名归属与当前可用性未独立核验。</p></>:<a class="button" href={a.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看官方资料 ↗</a>}<p class="data-caption">品牌资料与站长实测记录</p></div><nav class="brand-aside-links" aria-label="继续比较"><a href={'/compare/?brands='+a.slug}>将此品牌加入比较 ⇄</a><a href="/airport/">浏览全部品牌 →</a><a href="#brand-reading">相关知识与教程 →</a></nav></aside>
</div>
